        {
          "dimension": "Market / volatility absorption",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "xPosition holders absorb all price volatility for the paired stablecoin — in extreme downturns, xPosition NAV can approach zero before the system rebalances, concentrating tail-risk on leveraged side.",
